      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Why us?</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p>High-quality microphones and studio equipment guarantee a clean, professional sound for every recording. Our voice artists have many years of experience in the advertising industry.</p>
          <p>The fee for an advertising spot includes a licence for up to 12 months. We also offer audio-video editing — we'll prepare a ready-to-air material with the voice track laid in.</p>
          <p>Fast production — standard turnaround in 24-48 hours. In express mode, even on the same day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a href="/en/#kreator" class="bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-center transition-colors">Prepare your spot script</a>
          <a href="/en/pricing/" class="border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-400 text-gray-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-center transition-colors">View pricing</a>
