<!-- Popular voices -->
<section class="py-16" style="background-color:#efe8df">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">Advertising Voice Artists</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <% var recIds = ['jacek-brzostynski', 'maciej-jablonski', 'malgorzata', 'anita']; %>
      <% recIds.forEach(function(pid) { %>
        <% var v = voices.find(function(x) { return x.id === pid; }); %>
        <% if (v) { %>
        <a href="/lektorzy/<%= v.id %>/" class="text-center group">
          <img src="<%= v.photo %>" alt="<%= v.name %>" class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full mx-auto object-cover border-2 border-gray-200 group-hover:border-accent transition-all mb-2" loading="lazy">
          <div class="text-gray-900 font-semibold text-sm group-hover:text-accent transition-colors"><%= v.name %></div>
        </a>
        <% } %>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-8">
      <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium text-sm">Browse all voice artists &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SEO content -->
<section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-10">

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Professional voice artist for advertising</h2>
      <p>Choosing the right voice for your advertisement has a huge impact on how effective your message will be. A professional voice artist doesn't just read the script — they give it the right tone and emotion to capture your audience's attention. At our recording studio, we focus on quality, precision and a professional approach to every production. We offer top-tier voiceover recordings that work perfectly in advertising campaigns — television, radio and online.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">What makes the best voice for TV and radio commercials?</h3>
      <p>The best voice for a commercial is one that fits the product, the target audience and the ad format. There is no single ideal voice — it all depends on the emotions the recording needs to evoke. In our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:underline">voice bank</a> you'll find artists with deep, broadcast-quality tones as well as more neutral, versatile voices. We also offer foreign-language voice artists, allowing you to run advertising campaigns in other languages.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">How much does a voiceover recording cost and what affects the price?</h3>
      <p>Voiceover prices depend on several factors: script length, medium type (radio, TV, online), campaign reach and the licence duration. If you're wondering how much a voice for your ad costs — <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-accent hover:underline">get in touch</a> and we'll prepare a personalised quote. We treat every recording individually. Our studio guarantees fast turnaround and transparent terms.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">How does the voice recording process work?</h3>
      <p>Voiceover production is a creative process that requires experience and an understanding of the client's needs. First, we select a voice from our database together with the client. Then the artist records the script in our professional studio, maintaining the right pace, emotion and style. After recording, the material is edited and cleaned. The file format and audio signal level are normalised according to the requirements of the target broadcaster or platform.</p>
      <p class="mt-3">To speed up the process and give you real-time influence over the performance, we also offer <a href="/en/remote-sessions/" class="text-accent hover:underline">remote participation in the recording session</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Voice bank — find the ideal voice for your ads</h3>
      <p>Our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:underline">voice bank</a> is a rich database of voice artists — both local and international. It lets you quickly compare available voices and choose the one that best fits your project. Pick a voice that will capture your customers' attention and set your ad apart from the competition.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

